     "I&#39;ve got inla working on mac m3 homebrew.  <div><br></div><div>1- install INLA from here</div><div><a href=\"https://inla.r-inla-download.org/R/testing/bin/macosx/sonoma-arm64/contrib/4.3/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://inla.r-inla-download.org/R/testing/bin/macosx/sonoma-arm64/contrib/4.3/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792435368014000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Vdec6sgsZeim24fyRA0mZ\">https://inla.r-inla-download.org/R/testing/bin/macosx/sonoma-arm64/contrib/4.3/</a><br></div><div><br></div><div>2- make symbolic link to </div><div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>/opt/homebrew/lib/R/4.3/site-library/INLA/bin/mac.arm64/libRblas.0.dylib </p></div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div>from</div><div><br></div><div>/Library/Frameworks/R.framework/Versions/4.3-arm64/Resources/<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">libRblas.dylib</span><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">see</span></div><div><a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/bin/macosx/RMacOSX-FAQ.html#Which-BLAS-is-used-and-how-can-it-be-changed_003f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/bin/macosx/RMacOSX-FAQ.html%23Which-BLAS-is-used-and-how-can-it-be-changed_003f&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792435368014000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3aTSrx3WJQC1NVzsJFINLE\">https://cran.r-project.org/bin/macosx/RMacOSX-FAQ.html#Which-BLAS-is-used-and-how-can-it-be-changed_003f</a><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div>"
